DESCRIPTION:The Pregnancy Meeting is the annual scientific meeting of the
  Society for Maternal Fetal Medicine\, featuring postgraduate courses\, 
 scientific forums\, and oral and poster presentations on maternal fetal 
 medicine. The 2027 edition takes place at the Gaylord National in Nation
 al Harbor\, Maryland.\n\nDeadlines\nAbstract submission opens: 2026-07-1
 0\nAbstract submission: 2026-09-14\nAbstract notification: 2026-11-06\nA
 bstract withdrawal deadline: 2026-11-13\nRegistration opens: 2026-10-05\
 nLate-breaking abstract submission opens: 2026-11-16\nLate-breaking abst
 ract submission: 2026-12-21\nLate-breaking abstract notification: 2027-0
 1-11\n\nhttps://www.smfm.org/events/2027-pregnancy-meeting
LOCATION:National Harbor\, Maryland\, Gaylord National Resort and Convent
 ion Center
URL:https://www.smfm.org/events/2027-pregnancy-meeting
